Chapter: Nine days

The paragraph: In June the share price fell from 104.5 euros to 1.28 euros. Nobody could stop it.

This graphic covers: The share price fell from 104.5 euros to 1.28 euros.
Length: 5.0 s

Words spoken in it, from its start:
0.3 s  Jane
0.8 s  Doe,
1.3 s  the
1.8 s  chief
2.3 s  financial
2.8 s  officer.

Intent: Jane Doe is the chief financial officer.
Rests on claims: 4

A passing design of this technique (lower-third: an accent bar that stands up first, the name sliding out from behind it and the role building on a widening band), in this sandbox and on the tokens, for its mechanics, its timing and its standard. It uses: door, cause to effect. Its concept came from its own narration: find this slot's own rather than reusing its layout. Its words and figures are its own; yours come from this slot and its claims:
